  "not_drawn": {
    "R06": "Guest is a person without an account, and no information about a Guest is stored.",
    "R46": "Visibility of private and public Albums is a rule of access, which uses Public status and the owner, but stores no new data.",
    "R47": "Deleting the data of a User with its account is a rule of deletion, which Chen notation cannot show.",
    "R23": "Mocktail is a rule over Total alcohol percentage of a Drink Version (equal to zero), so it is not a separate stored value."
  },
  "assumptions": [
    "R02: Username is the key of User. Email is also unique, which Chen notation cannot show with a second underline.",
    "R10: Version numbers of a Drink are consecutive from 1, and a new Drink Version gets the highest number plus one.",
    "R12: A new Drink Version continues a branch only from the latest Drink Version of that branch, which Chen notation cannot show.",
    "R13, R33: Message of a Drink Version and Notes of a Review can be empty.",
    "R14: Base spirit is empty for a Drink without alcohol.",
    "R15: A Drink Version of a classic Drink has no author, so User is 0..1 in authors.",
    "R16: A new Drink Version made by another User belongs to the same Drink and does not change its parent.",
    "R25: Estimated match is calculated, when the Drink Version is saved, from its Ingredients and the Flavour Preferences it prefers.",
    "R27, R28, R29: Each Flavour Preferences belongs to exactly one User or exactly one Drink Version, never to both, which Chen notation cannot show.",
    "R32: A User can write many Reviews of one Drink Version, so Review is an entity with its own Identifier instead of the team's M:N relationship reviews.",
    "R35: Popularity counts the Reviews of all Drink Versions of a Drink and the Albums that contain the Drink.",
    "R39: Each User has exactly one Album of the kinds favourites, to check out and your drinks, and they cannot be deleted.",
    "R40: Album without an Icon uses the default icon.",
    "R42: A Drink is contained in an Album only once, which follows from the M:N relationship includes.",
    "R44: Album of the kind your drinks contains exactly the Drinks with a Drink Version authored by its owner.",
    "R07, R30, R37: Identifier is the key of Drink, Review and Album, because no other attribute of them is unique.",
    "R25: Estimated match belongs to the relationship prefers of a Drink Version, because it compares the Drink Version with the Flavour Preferences it prefers.",
    "R11: is based on joins a Drink Version with the Drink Version of the same Drink, from which it was made (the team ERD's has_parent). Each Drink Version is based on 0..1 Drink Versions, and 0..N Drink Versions can be based on one.",
    "R11: The base Drink Version belongs to the same Drink and has a lower version number, which Chen notation cannot show."
  ]
}